# Vendored @requarks/ckeditor5 build (19.0.1-wiki.3 + Citation plugin)

Rebuild from the sibling wiki-ckeditor5 repo:

    cd ../wiki-ckeditor5 && npm install && NODE_OPTIONS=--openssl-legacy-provider npm run build
    cp build/ckeditor.js build/ckeditor.js.map ../wiki/client/vendor/wiki-ckeditor5/

Source: https://github.com/Requarks/wiki-ckeditor5
